4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h6XouplGCp4Q7kNvwE6cdNY&_nc_oc=AdqkRaKqC126OSnNEo58aqEixSwemvGw9zisj_aZJsqB1R05qUv75v7dDVY9lqDGh5Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHUH2Ts-feMh5kz2qXYgfUYEW-S2dqkKUs_0UWUPXUOow&oe=6A8063D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=20Fc7j6bP0kQ7kNvwG7I39E&_nc_oc=AdpSK22e7RvjkU13CjHIr3W3q97BM9RuNvuYDEOPu33ijtnIm4lPBIjTv3CNozN6dJo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFDhmXbPyJ2DCb2L6XVT4-7cgABnbycMxMQSU1CRs3_2Q&oe=6A8068B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lXQuow3aEHgQ7kNvwGWpYbu&_nc_oc=AdptY0STqA_0NYStsWuZpkLlN0YMSB-GMXc9MkcljxUcf7O48u6vSJP2ZaP7JIK2-aI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGlwReduq2TNCeVhKQ9rgKbbx8XOu-eslNj0dPk0SxhPg&oe=6A803E15"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p